@crew v-lowe-adaeze
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Adaeze. Works, on my way to Marra Station. Need a hand?
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Kovac let me hold the stopwatch. Big day.   #funny
?

== chat
- Between postings is the strangest job. Nothing to do and all day to do it.   #funny
- Marra Station next. Three panels, I'm told. Can't wait.

== near
? habit:window-seat
- Window seat. I've counted the same stars every night. They're still there.
? habit:stargazer
- Observatory. Your big telescope's lovely. Tell nobody I said so.
?

== bye
- {bye}. If anything needs a second pair of hands, I'm free.

== smalltalk
- Need a hand?
- Still there. Good stars.
